MID_Calendar_SpecialDining: Gourmand Appreciation Day
MID_Calendar_SpecialDining_Help: Meals at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Inn are half their\nnormal price.
MID_Calendar_Festival00: Solar Celebration
MID_Calendar_Festival00_Help: The festival of Solel, the Sunbearer.\nOn this day, the people of Dagsion\ngive thanks for the sun's blessings.
MID_Calendar_Festival01: Aurora's Star Observance
MID_Calendar_Festival01_Help: A day to pray to Aurora, the\nNavigator's Clarion, for safe\nsea voyages this year.
MID_Calendar_Festival02: Mars's Festival
MID_Calendar_Festival02_Help: Celebrating Mars, the Bringer of\nWar, and the further development\nof the empire.
MID_Calendar_Festival03: Smyrnos's Magic Gala
MID_Calendar_Festival03_Help: A day to petition Smyrnos, the\nSpell-Scholar, for innovation in\nmagic and the empire.
MID_Calendar_Festival04: Kalla's Arts Festival
MID_Calendar_Festival04_Help: A day for Kalla, the Patron-\nHuntress. Considered auspicious\nfor undertaking new ventures.
MID_Calendar_Festival05: Fortuna's Fate Ritual
MID_Calendar_Festival05_Help: A day for prayers to Fortuna,\nGoddess of Fate, and for savoring\nthe blessings of a peaceful life.
MID_Calendar_Festival06: Sirius Festival
MID_Calendar_Festival06_Help: A day of great importance to the\nDivine Emperor and his empire.\nAll in Dagsion come out for it.
MID_Calendar_Festival07: Service for the Dead
MID_Calendar_Festival07_Help: A solemn day to beseech Yu Phas,\nKeeper of Death and Night, to lead\nsouls of ancestors to peace.
MID_Calendar_Festival08: Jurah's Harvest Festival
MID_Calendar_Festival08_Help: A festival to pray to Jurah, the\nGiver of Fertility, for a bountiful\nharvest in the coming year.
MID_Calendar_Festival09: Credna's Hammer Day
MID_Calendar_Festival09_Help: On this day, people from all over\nDagda flock to Dagsion to honor\nCredna, Spark of the Forge.
MID_Calendar_Festival10: Imperial Founding Day
MID_Calendar_Festival10_Help: The anniversary of the founding of\nthe Dagdan Empire is always an\noccasion for grand ceremonials.
MID_Calendar_Festival11: Dagda's Advent Festival
MID_Calendar_Festival11_Help: A commemoration of the day on\nwhich the Divine Emperor Dagda\ndescended to this land.
MID_Calendar_Temple_Aurora: Aurora's Day
MID_Calendar_Temple_Aurora_Help: Service at Aurora's temple has\nincreased effects.
MID_Calendar_Temple_Mars: Mars's Day
MID_Calendar_Temple_Mars_Help: Mars will receive guests at his\nbranch temple. Service at Mars's\ntemple has increased effects.
MID_Calendar_Temple_Smirnoth: Smyrnos's Day
MID_Calendar_Temple_Smirnoth_Help: Smyrnos will receive guests at his\nbranch temple. Service at Smyrnos's\ntemple has increased effects.
MID_Calendar_Temple_Juno: Jurah's Day
MID_Calendar_Temple_Juno_Help: Jurah will receive guests at her\nbranch temple. Service at Jurah's\ntemple has increased effects.
MID_Calendar_Temple_Cara: Kalla's Day
MID_Calendar_Temple_Cara_Help: Kalla will receive guests at her\nbranch temple. Service at Kalla's\ntemple has increased effects.
MID_Calendar_Temple_Clair: Credna's Day
MID_Calendar_Temple_Clair_Help: Service at Credna's temple has\nincreased effects.
MID_Calendar_Temple_All: Dagda's Day
MID_Calendar_Temple_All_Help: All gods receive guests at their\nbranch temples. Service at all\ntemples has increased effects.
MID_Calendar_Festival12: Blighted Eclipse
MID_Calendar_Festival12_Help: On the arrival of the solar eclipse,\nBalor's power reaches its peak,\nspilling out from the underworld.
MID_Calendar_SpecialFishing: Spring Tide
MID_Calendar_SpecialFishing_Help: The tide makes fish more active,\nso fishing on this day is said to\nincrease the odds of a good catch.
MID_Calendar_SpecialHarvest: Black Moon's Reaping
MID_Calendar_SpecialHarvest_Help: Plant growth is stimulated on this\nday, so it's an auspicious time to\nharvest crops.
MID_Calendar_SpecialMining: Crystalline Brilliance
MID_Calendar_SpecialMining_Help: Under a full moon that shines\nlike a jewel, mining efforts are said\nto yield more favorable results.
MID_Calendar_miniFestival00: Golden Crow's Rest Day
MID_Calendar_miniFestival00_Help: The Divine Sovereign decreed that\nthe 17th of each month would be\na celebration of the sun's light.
MID_Calendar_Divination: Mysterious Fortune Teller
MID_Calendar_Divination_Help: The fortune teller causing a stir is\nopen for business in Dagsion.
MID_Calendar_Temple_Cara_Help_Part3: Service at Kalla's temple has\nincreased effects.
MID_Calendar_Temple_Mars_Help_Part3: Service at Mars's temple has\nincreased effects.
MID_Calendar_Temple_Smirnoth_Help_Part3: Service at Smyrnos's temple has\nincreased effects.
MID_Calendar_Temple_Juno_Help_Part3: Service at Jurah's temple has\nincreased effects.
MID_Calendar_Temple_All_Help_Part3: Service at all temples has\nincreased effects.
