MID_HonorLvMenu_Farm: Lets you {LowercaseNextLetter}Farm more plots at once.
MID_HonorLvNotice_Farm: More plots can now be {LowercaseNextLetter}Farmed at once.
MID_HonorLvMenu_Lesson: Opens up new lessons from {LowercaseNextLetter}Mentoring.
MID_HonorLvNotice_Lesson: New lessons from {LowercaseNextLetter}Mentoring are available.
MID_HonorLvMenu_Dispatch: Lets you {LowercaseNextLetter}Deploy more battalions at once.
MID_HonorLvNotice_Dispatch: Can now {LowercaseNextLetter}Deploy more battalions at once.
MID_HonorLvMenu_Recruit: Yields higher-quality battalions from Recruit Soldiers.
MID_HonorLvNotice_Recruit: Recruit Soldiers now yields higher-quality battalions.
MID_HonorLvMenu_Speech: Unlocks Rousing Speech on the {Lowercase}World Map{NormalCase}.
MID_HonorLvNotice_Speech: Rousing Speech is now available on the {Lowercase}World Map{NormalCase}.
